    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch04-22: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.81";
    dc:description "The named class is directly simulable and the existential presence of complex or localized behavior can be reproduced under precision checks. Standard computation can distinguish robust structures from approximation artifacts within weeks.";
