    dc:type "resolution-route/computation";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Implement the specified continuous-valued local update maps, run them at increasing numerical precision, and quantify spatiotemporal complexity and persistent localized structures using the same metrics as discrete automata. Precision-stable examples confirm the existential comparison.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-gpt-5.6-sol-medium>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Numerical precision and discretization can create artifacts.", "Same kind of complexity requires a cross-system metric.";
